{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1460982-scion-dragon-transformation-knack-power-tasting-bite","id":1460982,"title":"Scion Dragon Transformation knack power tasting bite","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-09-22T22:06:30-07:00","id":1460982,"title":"Scion Dragon Transformation knack power tasting bite","content":"Hello guys! I got a Liriel inssue in my last game, a player tryed to use the transformation knack \u201cPower Tasting Bite\u201d, at long range with a sniper, since the text of the knack only says he need \u201cinflict damage \u201c on enemy. I was wondering if it was really intended by the rules to use this knack like that, or not. What are you guys think about it ? This knack should be only used as a literal bite? Or using it in a long range \u201csounds\u201d okay?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5311-thiagocord","name":"Thiagocord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T12:12:11-07:00","id":1461065,"title":"","content":"I would say the name includes the word &quot;bite&quot;, so it would have to be a physical bite to get the effect. You can't &quot;taste&quot; power with a bullet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5627-purple-snit","name":"Purple Snit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5627_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"309"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-24T05:02:34-07:00","id":1461186,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Purple Snit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1460982-scion-dragon-transformation-knack-power-tasting-bite?p=1461065#post1461065\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would say the name includes the word &amp;quot;bite&amp;quot;, so it would have to be a physical bite to get the effect. You can't &amp;quot;taste&amp;quot; power with a bullet.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah it make sense, but it would be a lot easier if the text said something like \u201cany injurie made at close range from a bite\u201d or if the text explanation on transformation knack was more strict saying about using the supernatural powers only with the \u201cpart transformed\u201d or something like that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5311-thiagocord","name":"Thiagocord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}